# the Steps list (2026-10-26): COPY TO EMPTY (the pattern with its locks into the track's first empty pattern, which
# the scene then plays; the scene it was copied from keeps the original), CLEAR BAR (undone), CLEAR's choices, ROTATE
# leaving the list up, each list opening on the row used last; the theme the FM-1's, kept when a project loads
wait 300
projnew
pat 2 1 32
step 2 1 1 60 100
step 2 1 17 64 100
lock 2 1 1 e1 30
turn ALGO 1
expect trk 2
# scene 2: a copy of scene 1, the same patterns
tap HOME
tapkey w1
wait 100
expect scene 2
tap SEQ
expect pat2 1
listen
tap SEL
wait 200
said COPY TO EMPTY P2
shot copy_list.png
tap SEL
wait 100
expect listopen 0
expect pat2 2
expect spat1.2 1
expect spat2.2 2
expect note 2 2 1 60
expect note 2 2 17 64
expect lane 2 2 e1 1
# the list opens on the row used last, now pointing at P3
tap SEL
wait 200
said COPY TO EMPTY P3
tap HOME
# CLEAR BAR on the copy's bar 2: its note goes, bar 1 stays, the original keeps both; undone
tap OCT+
tap SEL
row CLEAR BAR
wait 200
said bar 2. CLEAR BAR
tap SEL
wait 50
expect note 2 2 17 0
expect note 2 2 1 60
expect note 2 1 17 64
press HOME
tap REC
release HOME
expect note 2 2 17 64
tap OCT-
# opens on CLEAR BAR again
tap SEL
wait 200
said CLEAR BAR
# ROTATE: R1 to start with; the list closes, and opens on ROTATE again
row ROTATE
tap SEL
wait 50
expect listopen 0
expect note 2 2 2 60
tap SEL
wait 200
said ROTATE R1
tap SEL
wait 50
expect note 2 2 3 60
# how far: ALGORITHM sets it (never 0), L2 moves two steps left
tap SEL
turn ALGO -2
wait 200
said ROTATE L2
tap SEL
wait 50
expect note 2 2 1 60
# SHIFT NOTES: +4 semitones, again (+8), then down 12; each its own undo
tap SEL
row SHIFT NOTES
turn ALGO 3
wait 200
said SHIFT NOTES +4
tap SEL
wait 50
expect listopen 0
expect note 2 2 1 64
tap SEL
tap SEL
wait 50
expect note 2 2 1 68
tap SEL
turn ALGO -15
wait 200
said SHIFT NOTES -12
tap SEL
wait 50
expect note 2 2 1 56
expect note 2 2 17 60
press HOME
tap REC
release HOME
expect note 2 2 1 68
tap SEL
# CLEAR, its choice "locks": the notes stay
row CLEAR
turn ALGO -2
turn ALGO 1
wait 200
said CLEAR locks
tap SEL
wait 50
expect listopen 0
expect lane 2 2 e1 0
expect note 2 2 1 68
# the FM-1's settings (the theme, Setup's list: NOTES here): set on Setup's list, kept when project 1 loads (and over
# a restart: the load writes them into the slot), and by a new project
projsave 1
expect theme 2
tap GLO
turn SELECT 5
expect page Setup
tap SEL
row THEME
turn ALGO 1
row NOTES
turn ALGO -1
tap HOME
expect theme 0
expect sendnotes 0
tap HOME
tap SEL
row LOAD PROJECT
tap SEL
wait 100
tap SEL
wait 300
expect ask 0
expect spat2.2 2
expect theme 0
expect sendnotes 0
reboot
wait 400
expect theme 0
expect sendnotes 0
projnew
expect theme 0
expect sendnotes 0
